{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Though he be fruitful among brethren</b> — from the root of באחו." "<b>He shall bear fruit</b> — like יפרה. החליא, like החלה. And the meaning: by way of parable, as he mentioned regarding their pasture, the account of how HaShem will kill them and destroy them." "<b>And he shall dry up</b> — like: וייבש, or according to its plain sense, that its waters will fail. And the meaning of 'this wind' — a parable for the enemy who will plunder."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:12.225291271Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}